70	2026-04-03 15:05:00.169203+00	{"pk": 46, "body": "<p>这一页用于承接旧子站首页中的国际会议与高端论坛方向，后续会聚合会议介绍、论坛内容和闭门交流活动。</p><p>它将与已经上线的会议报名页、会务手册页共同组成活动频道中的核心业务闭环。</p><p>后续会继续补充活动类型、参与对象和历史活动沉淀。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00040001", "slug": "executive-forums", "depth": 5, "intro": "承接旧 /sp/ 首页里的活动方向，用于聚合会议、论坛与闭门会内容。", "owner": null, "title": "国际会议与高端论坛", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/events/executive-forums/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "国际会议与高端论坛", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 52, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 52, "translation_key": "952b6333-33af-47a5-9ad6-1c3f5c27ed8d", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:14.075Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:14.075Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:14.055Z"}	\N	46	\N	35	1	国际会议与高端论坛
