72	2026-04-03 15:20:08.680924+00	{"pk": 30, "body": "<p>研究与前沿资讯频道用于承接原 <strong>Research &amp; Insights</strong> 的内容，但不再沿用旧主题式目录页，而是改成可持续维护的主题结构。</p><p>当前优先围绕能源与气候变化、汽车与交通、跨文化交流与国际合作三条主线组织研究输出，并逐步吸收旧主站文章。</p><p>后续这里会继续增加专题页、系列文章聚合和活动关联内容。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A0001", "slug": "research-insights", "depth": 4, "intro": "承接原 /sp/ 的 Research & Insights 频道，用于汇总观察文章、行业跟踪和专题判断。", "owner": null, "title": "研究与前沿资讯", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 3, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "研究与前沿资讯", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 54, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 54, "translation_key": "6780a926-a6c1-478f-84ef-753fee8f6e12", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.092Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.654Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.070Z"}	\N	30	\N	35	1	研究与前沿资讯
36	2026-04-03 15:04:12.633765+00	{"pk": 30, "body": "<p>研究与前沿资讯频道用于承接原 <strong>Research &amp; Insights</strong> 的内容，但不再沿用旧主题式目录页，而是改成可持续维护的主题结构。</p><p>当前优先围绕能源与气候变化、汽车与交通、跨文化交流与国际合作三条主线组织研究输出，并逐步吸收旧主站文章。</p><p>后续这里会继续增加专题页、系列文章聚合和活动关联内容。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A0001", "slug": "research-insights", "depth": 4, "intro": "承接原 /sp/ 的 Research & Insights 频道，用于汇总观察文章、行业跟踪和专题判断。", "owner": null, "title": "研究与前沿资讯", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "研究与前沿资讯", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "6780a926-a6c1-478f-84ef-753fee8f6e12", "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": null}	\N	30	\N	35	1	研究与前沿资讯
73	2026-04-03 15:20:08.857892+00	{"pk": 31, "body": "<p>这一页聚焦能源转型、气候治理、绿色投资与相关国际合作议题，作为新站研究频道中的重点主题页。</p><p>后续会持续汇聚政策观察、行业研究、专题文章和与会议活动相关的内容沉淀。</p><p>它的目标不是复制旧站单页，而是成为一个可持续积累内容的主题入口。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00010001", "slug": "energy-climate", "depth": 5, "intro": "承接旧 /sp/ 的聚焦领域之一，作为研究与前沿资讯频道下的正式页面。", "owner": null, "title": "能源与气候变化", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/energy-climate/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "能源与气候变化", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 55, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 55, "translation_key": "ea8015c2-6419-4d26-938d-dcbfe5e58d01", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.157Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.743Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.137Z"}	\N	31	\N	35	1	能源与气候变化
74	2026-04-03 15:20:08.956578+00	{"pk": 32, "body": "<p>这一页用于承接汽车产业、交通体系、出海战略与相关国际市场观察内容。</p><p>现有关于东南亚汽车市场的文章会逐步归并到这里，后续继续扩展到供应链、交通政策和产业合作议题。</p><p>这一页会作为汽车研究相关内容的长期聚合页持续维护。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00010002", "slug": "auto-transport", "depth": 5, "intro": "承接旧 /sp/ 的聚焦领域之一，作为研究与前沿资讯频道下的正式页面。", "owner": null, "title": "汽车与交通", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/auto-transport/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "汽车与交通", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 56, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 56, "translation_key": "490b0d83-afdd-4437-bb13-1dae87a0001f", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.227Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.833Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.205Z"}	\N	32	\N	35	1	汽车与交通
71	2026-04-03 15:20:08.522618+00	{"pk": 16, "body": "<p>这里不再保留旧 <code>/sp</code> 作为第二套站点，而是把其中真正有价值的内容重构为新站中的统一频道。</p><p>当前已经拆分为研究与前沿资讯、能力建设、数据与调研、活动四个主频道，并开始把原先零散的二级栏目重建成独立页面。</p><p>后续所有新增内容都会优先写入新站页面，不再回流到旧 WordPress 结构中。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A", "slug": "workspace", "depth": 3, "intro": "原 /sp/ 的内容、栏目、服务线索和旧路径映射统一收敛到这里。", "owner": null, "title": "子系统频道", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 4, "url_path": "/home/workspace/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "子系统频道", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 53, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 53, "translation_key": "feca7b28-bda6-40ad-bcbf-7ac615bcf54c", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:58.996Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T14:53:24.413Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:58.964Z"}	\N	16	\N	35	1	子系统频道
76	2026-04-03 15:20:20.054091+00	{"pk": 16, "body": "<p>专题频道集中呈现研究内容、专题服务、数据能力与活动组织，方便访问者从同一入口进入不同主题。</p><p>频道结构围绕研究与前沿资讯、能力建设、数据与调研、活动四个方向展开，每个方向都由独立页面承接具体内容。</p><p>文章、服务说明、活动页与专题内容在这里形成统一的内容矩阵，保持清晰、稳定的访问体验。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A", "slug": "workspace", "depth": 3, "intro": "围绕研究、能力建设、数据服务与活动组织形成一组彼此联动的专题频道。", "owner": null, "title": "专题频道", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 4, "url_path": "/home/workspace/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "子系统频道", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 71, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 71, "translation_key": "feca7b28-bda6-40ad-bcbf-7ac615bcf54c", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:20:08.560Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T14:53:24.413Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:20:08.522Z"}	\N	16	\N	35	1	专题频道
