54	2026-04-03 15:04:59.070505+00	{"pk": 30, "body": "<p>研究与前沿资讯频道用于承接原 <strong>Research &amp; Insights</strong> 的内容，但不再沿用旧主题式目录页，而是改成可持续维护的主题结构。</p><p>当前优先围绕能源与气候变化、汽车与交通、跨文化交流与国际合作三条主线组织研究输出，并逐步吸收旧主站文章。</p><p>后续这里会继续增加专题页、系列文章聚合和活动关联内容。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A0001", "slug": "research-insights", "depth": 4, "intro": "承接原 /sp/ 的 Research & Insights 频道，用于汇总观察文章、行业跟踪和专题判断。", "owner": null, "title": "研究与前沿资讯", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 3, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "研究与前沿资讯", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 36, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 36, "translation_key": "6780a926-a6c1-478f-84ef-753fee8f6e12", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.654Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.654Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.633Z"}	\N	30	\N	35	1	研究与前沿资讯
78	2026-04-03 15:20:20.178035+00	{"pk": 30, "body": "<p>研究与前沿资讯频道围绕重点议题持续发布观察文章、专题解读与主题内容，让不同形式的研究输出保持统一表达。</p><p>频道优先围绕能源与气候变化、汽车与交通、跨文化交流与国际合作三条主线组织内容，形成清晰的议题结构。</p><p>文章、专题页与活动议题可以在这里相互关联，便于持续积累和查阅。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A0001", "slug": "research-insights", "depth": 4, "intro": "用于汇总观察文章、行业跟踪、专题判断与议题内容。", "owner": null, "title": "研究与前沿资讯", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 3, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "研究与前沿资讯", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 72, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 72, "translation_key": "6780a926-a6c1-478f-84ef-753fee8f6e12", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:20:08.712Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.654Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:20:08.680Z"}	\N	30	\N	35	1	研究与前沿资讯
79	2026-04-03 15:20:20.259962+00	{"pk": 31, "body": "<p>能源与气候变化页面围绕能源转型、气候治理、绿色投资和国际合作展开，适合承接政策观察、行业研究与专题讨论。</p><p>页面内容强调议题判断与结构化梳理，帮助读者快速把握政策变化、产业趋势与合作方向。</p><p>相关研究文章、活动议题和可持续发展主题内容均可在这里集中呈现。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00010001", "slug": "energy-climate", "depth": 5, "intro": "聚焦能源转型、气候治理、绿色投资与相关国际合作议题。", "owner": null, "title": "能源与气候变化", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/energy-climate/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "能源与气候变化", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 73, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 73, "translation_key": "ea8015c2-6419-4d26-938d-dcbfe5e58d01", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:20:08.895Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.743Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:20:08.857Z"}	\N	31	\N	35	1	能源与气候变化
56	2026-04-03 15:04:59.20575+00	{"pk": 32, "body": "<p>这一页用于承接汽车产业、交通体系、出海战略与相关国际市场观察内容。</p><p>现有关于东南亚汽车市场的文章会逐步归并到这里，后续继续扩展到供应链、交通政策和产业合作议题。</p><p>这一页会作为汽车研究相关内容的长期聚合页持续维护。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00010002", "slug": "auto-transport", "depth": 5, "intro": "承接旧 /sp/ 的聚焦领域之一，作为研究与前沿资讯频道下的正式页面。", "owner": null, "title": "汽车与交通", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/auto-transport/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "汽车与交通", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 38, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 38, "translation_key": "490b0d83-afdd-4437-bb13-1dae87a0001f", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.833Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.833Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.813Z"}	\N	32	\N	35	1	汽车与交通
81	2026-04-03 15:20:20.334045+00	{"pk": 32, "body": "<p>汽车与交通页面聚焦产业链变化、区域市场机会、交通体系升级和企业出海等关键主题。</p><p>页面适合呈现市场观察、区域研究、企业对标与政策分析，帮助读者理解行业演进与合作机会。</p><p>围绕东南亚及其他重点市场的相关内容，也将在这里形成更系统的主题归档。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00010002", "slug": "auto-transport", "depth": 5, "intro": "围绕汽车产业、交通体系、出海战略与区域市场变化组织研究内容。", "owner": null, "title": "汽车与交通", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/auto-transport/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "汽车与交通", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 74, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 74, "translation_key": "490b0d83-afdd-4437-bb13-1dae87a0001f", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:20:08.980Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.833Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:20:08.956Z"}	\N	32	\N	35	1	汽车与交通
57	2026-04-03 15:04:59.273796+00	{"pk": 33, "body": "<p>这一页用于承接跨文化交流、国际合作、海外考察、论坛对话等方向的研究与实践内容。</p><p>它会成为智库内容、活动内容和合作页面之间的连接层，用于组织多语境、多地区的交流主题。</p><p>后续会根据实际项目与活动沉淀补充案例、议题和合作方式。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00010003", "slug": "cross-cultural-cooperation", "depth": 5, "intro": "承接旧 /sp/ 的聚焦领域之一，作为研究与前沿资讯频道下的正式页面。", "owner": null, "title": "跨文化交流与国际合作", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/cross-cultural-cooperation/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "跨文化交流与国际合作", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 39, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 39, "translation_key": "198803cc-3c7a-4ed4-b63e-e1f793193ce7", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.922Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.922Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.901Z"}	\N	33	\N	35	1	跨文化交流与国际合作
75	2026-04-03 15:20:09.033545+00	{"pk": 33, "body": "<p>这一页用于承接跨文化交流、国际合作、海外考察、论坛对话等方向的研究与实践内容。</p><p>它会成为智库内容、活动内容和合作页面之间的连接层，用于组织多语境、多地区的交流主题。</p><p>后续会根据实际项目与活动沉淀补充案例、议题和合作方式。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00010003", "slug": "cross-cultural-cooperation", "depth": 5, "intro": "承接旧 /sp/ 的聚焦领域之一，作为研究与前沿资讯频道下的正式页面。", "owner": null, "title": "跨文化交流与国际合作", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/cross-cultural-cooperation/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "跨文化交流与国际合作", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 57, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 57, "translation_key": "198803cc-3c7a-4ed4-b63e-e1f793193ce7", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.295Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.922Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.273Z"}	\N	33	\N	35	1	跨文化交流与国际合作
82	2026-04-03 15:20:20.425068+00	{"pk": 33, "body": "<p>跨文化交流与国际合作页面适合承接合作议题、论坛对话、海外考察与多边交流相关内容。</p><p>页面强调多地区、多语境下的议题组织方式，让研究内容、活动信息与合作场景形成统一表达。</p><p>对于需要跨区域理解和交流支持的主题，这里提供清晰的内容入口。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00010003", "slug": "cross-cultural-cooperation", "depth": 5, "intro": "用于呈现跨文化交流、国际合作、海外考察与论坛对话等方向内容。", "owner": null, "title": "跨文化交流与国际合作", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/research-insights/cross-cultural-cooperation/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "跨文化交流与国际合作", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 75, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 75, "translation_key": "198803cc-3c7a-4ed4-b63e-e1f793193ce7", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:20:09.055Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:12.922Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:20:09.033Z"}	\N	33	\N	35	1	跨文化交流与国际合作
83	2026-04-03 15:20:20.497527+00	{"pk": 34, "body": "<p>能力建设频道集中介绍服务方向、合作方式和典型场景，让访问者快速了解 DAXA 的核心能力结构。</p><p>频道围绕资产管理、投资银行、项目咨询与标准制定四个方向展开，便于按需浏览具体服务页面。</p><p>每个页面都强调适用场景、服务内容与协作方式，保持清楚、克制的对外表达。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A0002", "slug": "capabilities", "depth": 4, "intro": "围绕训练营、工作坊、咨询支持与方法论服务形成清晰的能力说明频道。", "owner": null, "title": "能力建设", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 4, "url_path": "/home/workspace/capabilities/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "能力建设", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 58, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 58, "translation_key": "6d2dc9a6-c7b1-4389-828d-3be8b0602756", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.364Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.009Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.343Z"}	\N	34	\N	35	1	能力建设
84	2026-04-03 15:20:20.571045+00	{"pk": 35, "body": "<p>资产管理页面围绕行业研究、组合构建支持、定量分析与风险协同展开，适合说明与投资判断相关的研究服务。</p><p>页面强调分析方法、研究深度和场景适配，而不是抽象的产品化表述。</p><p>对于需要兼顾行业趋势、资产配置和专题判断的合作场景，这里提供清晰的服务入口。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00020001", "slug": "asset-management", "depth": 5, "intro": "聚焦资产组合研究、量化分析、行业判断与风险协同。", "owner": null, "title": "资产管理", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/capabilities/asset-management/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "资产管理", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 59, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 59, "translation_key": "9b7ec799-466f-4a5b-9b72-8cba7952f13c", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.438Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.097Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.415Z"}	\N	35	\N	35	1	资产管理
85	2026-04-03 15:20:20.644207+00	{"pk": 36, "body": "<p>投资银行页面面向行业扫描、项目尽调、交易跟踪与专题研究等协作场景，突出研究支持与信息整合能力。</p><p>页面适合承接跨境项目、重点行业和区域市场的辅助研究需求，帮助形成更清楚的决策材料。</p><p>围绕项目推进所需的情报整理、对标分析与专题简报，也可在这里统一介绍。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00020002", "slug": "investment-banking", "depth": 5, "intro": "聚焦行业情报、尽调支持、交易观察与项目研究。", "owner": null, "title": "投资银行", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/capabilities/investment-banking/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "投资银行", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 60, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 60, "translation_key": "aff927de-cea6-4188-80dc-2c38fa8576de", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.507Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.189Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.485Z"}	\N	36	\N	35	1	投资银行
86	2026-04-03 15:20:20.7158+00	{"pk": 37, "body": "<p>项目咨询页面聚焦项目诊断、研究支持、方案设计与执行协同，适合承接复杂议题下的专题服务说明。</p><p>页面以工作过程和交付结构为主线，帮助访问者理解从需求澄清到方案落地的协作逻辑。</p><p>对于需要整合研究、沟通与执行节奏的项目，这里提供清晰的合作入口。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00020003", "slug": "project-consulting", "depth": 5, "intro": "围绕项目诊断、议题梳理、方案设计与执行支持形成正式服务页面。", "owner": null, "title": "项目咨询", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/capabilities/project-consulting/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "项目咨询", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 61, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 61, "translation_key": "8ec8349e-35b8-4637-866c-4f4636e519cd", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.578Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.276Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.555Z"}	\N	37	\N	35	1	项目咨询
62	2026-04-03 15:04:59.623922+00	{"pk": 38, "body": "<p>标准制定页面用于承接旧子站中的标准制定方向，后续会围绕方法论、参与形式、合作机制和落地场景展开。</p><p>它的存在是为了把旧首页里只出现一次的服务线索转化为真正可访问、可维护的能力页面。</p><p>后续内容将根据实际材料继续细化。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00020004", "slug": "standards-development", "depth": 5, "intro": "承接旧 /sp/ 首页里的标准制定方向，整理为新站中的正式能力页面。", "owner": null, "title": "标准制定", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/capabilities/standards-development/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "标准制定", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 44, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 44, "translation_key": "c3c46f95-f188-4c8f-bd1c-c249c3d7c206", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.370Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.370Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.347Z"}	\N	38	\N	35	1	标准制定
87	2026-04-03 15:20:20.79636+00	{"pk": 38, "body": "<p>标准制定页面围绕方法论、参与机制、行业实践与协作流程展开，适合说明标准相关工作的组织方式。</p><p>页面强调研究准备、多方协同和落地场景，便于呈现标准议题背后的工作结构。</p><p>对于需要行业讨论、材料准备和协作支持的场景，这里提供集中说明。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00020004", "slug": "standards-development", "depth": 5, "intro": "围绕标准议题、方法设计、参与机制与行业落地场景展开。", "owner": null, "title": "标准制定", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/capabilities/standards-development/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "标准制定", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 62, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 62, "translation_key": "c3c46f95-f188-4c8f-bd1c-c249c3d7c206", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.644Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.370Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.623Z"}	\N	38	\N	35	1	标准制定
88	2026-04-03 15:20:20.867955+00	{"pk": 39, "body": "<p>数据与调研频道集中呈现数据库服务、研究支持和专题分析能力，帮助访问者快速理解数据相关的服务结构。</p><p>频道围绕风险管理、信用评级、金融数据、ESG 解决方案与数据库订阅展开，形成清晰的主题分布。</p><p>数据页面既服务于研究内容，也服务于项目协作和专题服务，是站点中的关键能力入口。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A0003", "slug": "data-analytics", "depth": 4, "intro": "用于介绍数据库、研究支持、风险分析和订阅服务等数据能力。", "owner": null, "title": "数据与调研", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 5, "url_path": "/home/workspace/data-analytics/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "数据与调研", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 63, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 63, "translation_key": "a65a2596-e506-495c-bbbc-86c0c0378dc8", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.713Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.461Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.692Z"}	\N	39	\N	35	1	数据与调研
89	2026-04-03 15:20:20.936181+00	{"pk": 40, "body": "<p>风险管理页面围绕信用风险、供应链波动、政策变化和气候风险等主题，形成贴近业务场景的分析入口。</p><p>页面适合说明判断框架、应用主题与典型问题，帮助读者理解风险分析的使用方式。</p><p>与信用评级、金融数据等页面配合使用时，也能够形成更完整的专题支持结构。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00030001", "slug": "risk-management", "depth": 5, "intro": "聚焦信用、供应链、政策变化与气候风险等分析场景。", "owner": null, "title": "风险管理", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/data-analytics/risk-management/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "风险管理", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 64, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 64, "translation_key": "205eedcd-88cd-40a1-b78b-7a73f08782e0", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.780Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.547Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.759Z"}	\N	40	\N	35	1	风险管理
65	2026-04-03 15:04:59.827406+00	{"pk": 41, "body": "<p>信用评级页面用于沉淀评级观点、信用研究、主体分析与对手方风险评估相关内容。</p><p>它会与风险管理和金融数据页形成互补关系，逐步构成更完整的信用分析能力结构。</p><p>后续页面内容会根据实际研究材料持续补强。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00030002", "slug": "credit-ratings", "depth": 5, "intro": "重建旧 /sp/ 的 Credit Ratings 页面，用于整理评级观点、信用研究与对手方风险判断。", "owner": null, "title": "信用评级", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/data-analytics/credit-ratings/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "信用评级", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 47, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 47, "translation_key": "4d87be92-5536-4dc4-8d91-3617e5b9ea30", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.632Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.632Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.613Z"}	\N	41	\N	35	1	信用评级
90	2026-04-03 15:20:21.006137+00	{"pk": 41, "body": "<p>信用评级页面聚焦主体信用、对手方风险与行业信用环境等主题，适合承接评级观点与专题研究内容。</p><p>页面强调研究判断与应用场景之间的关系，让信用分析更易于理解和使用。</p><p>与风险管理、金融数据页组合浏览时，可以更完整地呈现相关分析框架。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00030002", "slug": "credit-ratings", "depth": 5, "intro": "用于整理评级观点、信用研究与对手方风险判断。", "owner": null, "title": "信用评级", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/data-analytics/credit-ratings/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "信用评级", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 65, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 65, "translation_key": "4d87be92-5536-4dc4-8d91-3617e5b9ea30", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.848Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.632Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.827Z"}	\N	41	\N	35	1	信用评级
91	2026-04-03 15:20:21.076897+00	{"pk": 42, "body": "<p>金融数据页面聚焦基础面、估值、所有权和并购等关键数据方向，为行业研究和项目分析提供数据说明入口。</p><p>页面通过场景化表达说明数据的典型使用方式，帮助访问者快速理解服务价值。</p><p>对于需要行业扫描、对标研究和专题分析的读者，这里提供清楚的数据能力介绍。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00030003", "slug": "financial-data", "depth": 5, "intro": "用于整理基础面、估值、并购、所有权等金融数据能力。", "owner": null, "title": "金融数据", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/data-analytics/financial-data/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "金融数据", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 66, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 66, "translation_key": "31295070-a196-4979-9ca5-1a8b15fbf6a5", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.915Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.717Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.894Z"}	\N	42	\N	35	1	金融数据
92	2026-04-03 15:20:21.146303+00	{"pk": 43, "body": "<p>ESG 解决方案页面围绕环境、社会、治理相关数据与研究框架展开，适合介绍可持续议题中的分析支持能力。</p><p>页面连接能源与气候变化、投资判断与项目协作等主题，强调 ESG 内容的应用场景。</p><p>对于需要可持续发展主题支持的合作方向，这里形成明确的服务说明。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00030004", "slug": "esg-solutions", "depth": 5, "intro": "聚焦可持续数据、ESG 分析框架与相关研究支持。", "owner": null, "title": "ESG 解决方案", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/data-analytics/esg-solutions/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "ESG 解决方案", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 67, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 67, "translation_key": "75157144-755f-42d4-867e-362f2f6264a3", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.985Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.804Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:59.964Z"}	\N	43	\N	35	1	ESG 解决方案
68	2026-04-03 15:05:00.03275+00	{"pk": 44, "body": "<p>数据库订阅页面用于承接旧主站“大下数据库”和旧子站中数据订阅相关的线索。</p><p>它会逐步整理数据产品、订阅方式、适用对象与配套研究支持，不再让这一方向停留在首页单行词条。</p><p>后续会与金融数据、风险管理、信用评级和 ESG 页面形成更清晰的数据产品结构。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00030005", "slug": "database-subscription", "depth": 5, "intro": "承接旧主站和 /sp/ 中的数据订阅方向，统一为新站里的正式页面。", "owner": null, "title": "数据库订阅", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/data-analytics/database-subscription/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "数据库订阅", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 50, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 50, "translation_key": "fc243dd4-1d88-49b9-9db9-faf6aa9fc7f2", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.891Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.891Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.871Z"}	\N	44	\N	35	1	数据库订阅
93	2026-04-03 15:20:21.215013+00	{"pk": 44, "body": "<p>数据库订阅页面用于介绍数据订阅服务的结构、适用对象和典型使用方式，让产品说明与研究支持保持统一表达。</p><p>页面适合呈现数据范围、订阅形式和分析配套服务，帮助访问者快速理解合作方式。</p><p>与金融数据、风险管理、信用评级和 ESG 页面结合浏览时，可以更完整地呈现数据服务矩阵。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00030005", "slug": "database-subscription", "depth": 5, "intro": "用于介绍数据订阅服务、适用对象与配套研究支持。", "owner": null, "title": "数据库订阅", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/data-analytics/database-subscription/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "数据库订阅", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 68, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 68, "translation_key": "fc243dd4-1d88-49b9-9db9-faf6aa9fc7f2", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:05:00.053Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.891Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:05:00.032Z"}	\N	44	\N	35	1	数据库订阅
69	2026-04-03 15:05:00.100008+00	{"pk": 45, "body": "<p>活动频道用于承接旧子站中的论坛、会议、闭门交流和活动报名相关内容。</p><p>当前已经把会议报名与会务手册迁回新站，后续会继续将活动介绍、议题页和活动回顾统一纳入这里。</p><p>它会成为连接活动运营、会议报名和专题内容的重要频道。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A0004", "slug": "events", "depth": 4, "intro": "对应旧 /sp/ 的 Events 频道，统一承接国际会议、高端论坛、闭门会和会务流程。", "owner": null, "title": "活动", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 1, "url_path": "/home/workspace/events/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "活动", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 51, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 51, "translation_key": "d2bfc294-25da-4a49-8e7e-884d25c478b8", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.979Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.979Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.959Z"}	\N	45	\N	35	1	活动
94	2026-04-03 15:20:21.284083+00	{"pk": 45, "body": "<p>活动频道集中展示论坛、会议、闭门交流和报名流程，让活动信息、议题说明与会务内容形成统一入口。</p><p>频道适合承接活动介绍、报名入口、会务资料与回顾内容，帮助访问者快速获取完整信息。</p><p>活动页面与研究专题页之间可以相互连接，形成内容传播与交流组织的双向支撑。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A0004", "slug": "events", "depth": 4, "intro": "用于承接国际会议、高端论坛、闭门会和相关会务流程。", "owner": null, "title": "活动", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 1, "url_path": "/home/workspace/events/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "活动", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 69, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 69, "translation_key": "d2bfc294-25da-4a49-8e7e-884d25c478b8", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:05:00.122Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:13.979Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:05:00.100Z"}	\N	45	\N	35	1	活动
95	2026-04-03 15:20:21.351714+00	{"pk": 46, "body": "<p>国际会议与高端论坛页面用于集中介绍活动类型、议题方向、参与对象和相关会务入口。</p><p>页面既服务于活动报名，也适合承接论坛背景、议程信息和后续内容沉淀。</p><p>围绕重点活动形成的研究议题和合作主题，也可以在这里持续组织与呈现。</p>", "live": true, "path": "00010001000A00040001", "slug": "executive-forums", "depth": 5, "intro": "用于聚合国际会议、高端论坛与闭门交流相关内容。", "owner": null, "title": "国际会议与高端论坛", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/workspace/events/executive-forums/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "国际会议与高端论坛", "content_type": 35, "live_revision": 70, "show_in_menus": false, "latest_revision": 70, "translation_key": "952b6333-33af-47a5-9ad6-1c3f5c27ed8d", "last_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:05:00.191Z", "first_published_at": "2026-04-03T15:04:14.075Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2026-04-03T15:05:00.169Z"}	\N	46	\N	35	1	国际会议与高端论坛
